 "description": "List bank transactions awaiting bookkeeping review. Tabs: PENDING (nobody has reviewed the booking as it stands, whether the engine, a rule or a person made it), REVIEWED (a person marked it reviewed and it has not changed since; a trusted rule posting it on its own is not a review), EXCLUDED (deliberately kept out of the books). Every row is already in the books; the tab only says whether anyone has signed it off. Each row carries the cleaned counterparty name, the raw bank memo, the absolute amount with a money-in/money-out direction, the effective category, the income/expense account it books to, and a confidence marker. Returns counters for all three tabs alongside the page.",
